 #!/usr/bin/env python3                                                         
 """Turn-launcher template: stage seat-move notices, run, then consume.         
                                                                                
 Copy or symlink into                                                           
 ~/.hermes/profiles/plumbline-conductor/bin/seat-move-turn.py                   
 and call ``run_with_notices`` from the profile's own loop, passing a callable  
 that performs the real Bot Chat turn.  This module never shells out to         
 ``hermes`` and never writes the session; it only brackets the turn with        
 ``kit.seat_move_drain``.                                                       
